{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This dashboard shows **current size and growth over time** from existing collectors. It covers scraped ext4/XFS filesystems on nodes running node-exporter, each node/device counted once.\n\n**Per-disk attribution** comes from the `disk_usage:*` recording rules (`cluster/cdk8s/monitoring/rules.py`). Each component reports its own bytes and is placed on a disk through its pod's PVC host path: SeaweedFS volume files per collection (one series per replica, on the disk holding it), SeaweedFS bytes deleted but not yet vacuumed, ClickHouse MergeTree parts, CNPG database files on PGDATA (no WAL), and PVCs that kubelet measures. Unattributed is filesystem used (size minus free) minus those components: container images, emptyDir volumes, logs, etcd, node-local PVCs whose owner exports no size, and collector skew. Reserved is ext4's root-only reserve (free minus available). Media is the kernel's rotational flag; virtual disks report rotational whatever backs them, so they show as `virtual`.\n\nLower sections are per-collector detail. SeaweedFS bucket logical bytes omit replicas; physical bucket bytes and collection bytes mostly measure the same replicated data. Do not add the detailed charts together. Missing samples do not imply zero use."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Scraped node filesystems: used",
      "description": "Used bytes across ext4/XFS filesystems, deduplicated by node and device. Excludes unscraped or offline nodes.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": "${DS_MIMIR}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(max by (node, device) (max by (node, device, mountpoint) ((node_filesystem_size_bytes{fstype=~\"ext4|xfs\",device!=\"\"} - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{fstype=~\"ext4|xfs\",device!=\"\"}) * on (namespace, pod) group_left (node) max by (namespace, pod, node) (kube_pod_info{namespace=\"monitoring\",pod=~\"prometheus-node-exporter-.+\"}))))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Scraped node filesystems: capacity",
      "description": "Total ext4/XFS filesystem capacity, deduplicated by node and device.",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": "${DS_MIMIR}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(max by (node, device) (max by (node, device, mountpoint) (node_filesystem_size_bytes{fstype=~\"ext4|xfs\",device!=\"\"} * on (namespace, pod) group_left (node) max by (namespace, pod, node) (kube_pod_info{namespace=\"monitoring\",pod=~\"prometheus-node-exporter-.+\"}))))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "title": "Scraped disk capacity by use",
      "description": "All scraped filesystem capacity, summed per category across disks. Each component reports its own bytes and is placed on a disk through its pod's PVC host path: SeaweedFS volume files per collection (one series per replica, on the disk holding it), SeaweedFS bytes deleted but not yet vacuumed, ClickHouse MergeTree parts, CNPG database files on PGDATA (no WAL), and PVCs that kubelet measures. Unattributed is filesystem used (size minus free) minus those components: container images, emptyDir volumes, logs, etcd, node-local PVCs whose owner exports no size, and collector skew. Reserved is ext4's root-only reserve (free minus available).",
      "type": "piechart",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": "${DS_MIMIR}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (category) (disk_usage:component_used_bytes)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{category}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(disk_usage:unattributed_bytes)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Unattributed",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(disk_usage:filesystem_free_bytes - disk_usage:filesystem_avail_bytes)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Reserved (root only)",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum(disk_usage:filesystem_avail_bytes)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Free",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Free"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "rgba(115, 191, 105, 0.35)"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Unattributed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Reserved (root only)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8e8e8e"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "displayLabels": ["name", "percent"],
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "values": ["value", "percent"]
        },
        "pieType": "pie",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "$node",
      "repeat": "node",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "title": "Disks by component",
      "description": "One bar per scraped filesystem on this machine, labelled device · mountpoint · media (HDD, SSD or virtual); bar length is the filesystem size, and every machine's chart shares one scale (the largest disk in the cluster), so bars compare across machines. Hover a bar for every component's bytes on that disk. Each component reports its own bytes and is placed on a disk through its pod's PVC host path: SeaweedFS volume files per collection (one series per replica, on the disk holding it), SeaweedFS bytes deleted but not yet vacuumed, ClickHouse MergeTree parts, CNPG database files on PGDATA (no WAL), and PVCs that kubelet measures. Unattributed is filesystem used (size minus free) minus those components: container images, emptyDir volumes, logs, etcd, node-local PVCs whose owner exports no size, and collector skew. Reserved is ext4's root-only reserve (free minus available).",
      "type": "barchart",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "datasource": "${DS_MIMIR}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "label_join((sum by (node, device, component) (disk_usage:component_used_bytes{node=\"$node\"}) or label_replace(disk_usage:unattributed_bytes{node=\"$node\"}, \"component\", \"Unattributed\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(disk_usage:filesystem_free_bytes{node=\"$node\"} - disk_usage:filesystem_avail_bytes{node=\"$node\"}, \"component\", \"Reserved (root only)\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(disk_usage:filesystem_avail_bytes{node=\"$node\"}, \"component\", \"Free\", \"\", \"\")) * on (node, device) group_left (mountpoint, media) (topk by (node, device) (1, disk_usage:mount:info{node=\"$node\"}) * on (node, device) group_left (media) disk_usage:filesystem:info{node=\"$node\"}), \"disk\", \" · \", \"device\", \"mountpoint\", \"media\")",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "max(disk_usage:filesystem_size_bytes)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "MaxDisk"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "configFromData",
          "options": {
            "configRefId": "MaxDisk",
            "mappings": [
              {
                "fieldName": "Value #MaxDisk",
                "handlerKey": "max"
              },
              {
                "fieldName": "Time",
                "handlerKey": "__ignore"
              }
            ],
            "applyTo": {
              "id": "byType",
              "options": "number"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "groupingToMatrix",
          "options": {
            "columnField": "component",
            "rowField": "disk",
            "valueField": "Value #A",
            "emptyValue": "null"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {},
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "disk\\component",
                "desc": false
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {},
            "indexByName": {},
            "renameByName": {
              "disk\\component": "Disk"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 85,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisSoftMin": 0
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Free"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "rgba(115, 191, 105, 0.35)"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Unattributed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Reserved (root only)"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#8e8e8e"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "xField": "Disk",
        "stacking": "normal",
        "showValue": "never",
        "barWidth": 0.8,
        "groupWidth": 0.7,
        "xTickLabelMaxLength": 0,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc",
          "hideZeros": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Detail",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "title": "Per-disk attribution",
      "description": "Every component on every disk, with its share of that filesystem's size. Filter or sort a column to answer, for example, which disks hold a given SeaweedFS bucket. Each component reports its own bytes and is placed on a disk through its pod's PVC host path: SeaweedFS volume files per collection (one series per replica, on the disk holding it), SeaweedFS bytes deleted but not yet vacuumed, ClickHouse MergeTree parts, CNPG database files on PGDATA (no WAL), and PVCs that kubelet measures. Unattributed is filesystem used (size minus free) minus those components: container images, emptyDir volumes, logs, etcd, node-local PVCs whose owner exports no size, and collector skew. Reserved is ext4's root-only reserve (free minus available).",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "datasource": "${DS_MIMIR}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sort_desc((sum by (node, device, component) (disk_usage:component_used_bytes) or label_replace(disk_usage:unattributed_bytes, \"component\", \"Unattributed\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(disk_usage:filesystem_free_bytes - disk_usage:filesystem_avail_bytes, \"component\", \"Reserved (root only)\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(disk_usage:filesystem_avail_bytes, \"component\", \"Free\", \"\", \"\")) * on (node, device) group_left (mountpoint, media) (topk by (node, device) (1, disk_usage:mount:info) * on (node, device) group_left (media) disk_usage:filesystem:info))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "(sum by (node, device, component) (disk_usage:component_used_bytes) or label_replace(disk_usage:unattributed_bytes, \"component\", \"Unattributed\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(disk_usage:filesystem_free_bytes - disk_usage:filesystem_avail_bytes, \"component\", \"Reserved (root only)\", \"\", \"\") or label_replace(disk_usage:filesystem_avail_bytes, \"component\", \"Free\", \"\", \"\")) * on (node, device) group_left (mountpoint, media) (topk by (node, device) (1, disk_usage:mount:info) * on (node, device) group_left (media) disk_usage:filesystem:info) / on (node, device) group_left () disk_usage:filesystem_size_bytes",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "node": 0,
              "device": 1,
              "mountpoint": 2,
              "media": 3,
              "component": 4,
              "Value #A": 5,
              "Value #B": 6
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "node": "Machine",
              "device": "Device",
              "mountpoint": "Mountpoint",
              "media": "Media",
              "component": "Component",
              "Value #A": "Bytes",
              "Value #B": "Share of disk"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {},
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Bytes",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Share of disk"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percentunit"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "title": "Unattributed bytes per disk",
      "description": "Filesystem used (size minus free) minus every attributed component. On system disks (/var, /) this is mostly container images, emptyDir volumes, logs and etcd, which no scraped metric breaks down; on data disks, see the PVC list beside it.",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 42
      },
      "datasource": "${DS_MIMIR}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sort_desc(label_join(disk_usage:unattributed_bytes * on (node, device) group_left (mountpoint, media) (topk by (node, device) (1, disk_usage:mount:info) * on (node, device) group_left (media) disk_usage:filesystem:info), \"disk\", \" · \", \"node\", \"device\", \"mountpoint\", \"media\"))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{disk}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "orange"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "valueMode": "color",
        "namePlacement": "top",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull"],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "title": "Node-local PVCs with no usage metric",
      "description": "PVCs whose host path is on each disk but whose bytes no component reports, so they fall into Unattributed. The size is the PVC's requested capacity, not its use: local-path does not enforce it.",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 11,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 42
      },
      "datasource": "${DS_MIMIR}",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sort_desc(max by (node, device, namespace, persistentvolumeclaim) (disk_usage:pvc_filesystem:info unless on (namespace, persistentvolumeclaim) disk_usage:component_used_bytes) * on (namespace, persistentvolumeclaim) group_left () max by (namespace, persistentvolumeclaim) (kube_persistentvolumeclaim_resource_requests_storage_bytes))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "node": 0,
              "device": 1,
              "namespace": 2,
              "persistentvolumeclaim": 3,
              "Value": 4
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "node": "Machine",
              "device": "Device",
              "namespace": "Namespace",
              "persistentvolumeclaim": "PVC",
              "Value": "Requested"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
